== Notes ==

* Unlike [[Chicken|chickens]] and [[Rabbit|rabbits]], squirrels do not need to be fed and will stay alive in any container indefinitely.
* Squirrels found in Squirrel Caches, killed by foxes, or trampled by [[Horse|horses]] are ''not'' subject to a Survival hardcap, making these methods a good way for a fresh Hearthling to gather squirrels of higher quality.

